 406                       AND TAG3        /YES - DOES IT MATCH?
 407                       CLL CIA
 408                       TAD NAME3
 409                       SZA CLA
 410                       JMP GETTG2      /NO - TRY NEXT TAG
 411                       JMP I GETTAG    /YES--RETURN--
